Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,how did they escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Master... I swear I-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Twice you've failed me, Bellatrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter and his friends must already be on their way to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, please let me-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia. My golden snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.93,0:01:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have another chance to prove your loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Find your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Show those old witches what true efficiency looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You. Keep watch over the Gringotts vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform Snape and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You hexed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Crucio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sectumsempra!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia... I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you hate me this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop looking so sad for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! I'll get help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,my whole family...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Potter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've let you help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter was spotted in Hogsmeade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And seems he may already be inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the headmaster been informed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gathering the students in the great hall as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you stand where he stood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them how you looked him in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who trusted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go after him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But... my lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise, Profess-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you believe your courage will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How terribly mistaken you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not mistake my patience for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender Harry Potter. You have one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When that hour ends, there will be no mercy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I shall bury you all beneath the ruins of this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Students out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.55,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Students out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They are supposed to be out of bed, you blithering idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you're here... take the Slytherins and lock them in the dungeons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter, what do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.53,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as you can give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do what we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really expect us to fight You-Know-Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And call him Voldemort, Fillius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill you regardless of what you call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Piertotum Locomotor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally. I've always wanted to use that spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, it's a full moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,covered in fur by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife and I developed a new Wolfsbane Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps me human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, ey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And... does it actually work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's experimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope it lasts all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, if you get hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,please, eat them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever takes down the most has to clean the shop for a whole month.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:10:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Merlin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She actually told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! We can blow off the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this day would never come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're blowing up the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Protego Maxima!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fianto Duri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Repello Inimicum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Protego Maxima!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fianto Duri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If we catch Potter, the Dark Lord will reward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he'll even let me marry Draconia if I ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I catch Potter first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucius! Where is Draconia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is our daughter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told she stayed behind to find Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our daughter... is in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You remind me of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Diadem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,where everything is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.57,0:15:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The fun... is just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Murder them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be looking after the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's what Harry would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry would do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, just for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.11,0:17:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why all of you failed my classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise... I'll never turn in my homework late again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The potion... I knew it was experimental...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't expect it to wear off so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here. Leave me with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand aside. He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fenrir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking rough, Lupin. Want my vet's number?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A brave little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Crucio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how quickly that courage evaporates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ginny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the Weasleys even among the sacred twenty eight? So pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll fix that tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Draconia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Always so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:20:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Potter. You shouldn't have come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only made things easier for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't how I imagined our second dance, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.83,0:21:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me about the dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it meant nothing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither did what happened afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.48,0:21:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved every second of that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and that kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you kiss Cho?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.03,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know about Cho?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That year...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't helping that fat woman. I was helping you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I distracted her so she wouldn't find you or your pathetic little gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One night, I wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To warn you about her plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned Cho in to that horrible woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kiss beneath the mistletoe meant nothing to you, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.15,0:22:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There was mistletoe that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.46,0:23:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You took my glasses off. I couldn't see properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.66,0:23:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to talk about resentment, Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.76,0:23:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You watched them murder him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You took his wand!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You left him defenseless against Snape and the Death Eaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.86,0:23:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They would have killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I was the one who let the Death Eaters into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, little ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.18,0:24:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.42,0:24:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.54,0:25:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go after the bad guy's boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.98,0:25:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Children. The final boss, is called the final boss for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time we fought... it ended terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.73,0:25:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.37,0:25:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You used the Cruciatus curse on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you? You nearly ripped my insides out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You left me with scars!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a scar just beneath one of my breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.94,0:25:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I don't wear bikinis or those muggle things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.14,0:25:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd look dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.80,0:25:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we talking about bikinis and your breasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.09,0:25:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not! Just-
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.26,0:26:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop attacking me, you bloody idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.05,0:26:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That depends on you. Who's side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.79,0:26:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You already know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.38,0:26:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.98,0:26:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then why didn't you tell them it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.75,0:26:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.99,0:26:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:27:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew it was me. I saw it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you give me away?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.46,0:27:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, I-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.91,0:27:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't make me say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.92,0:27:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.18,0:27:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So... you have a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.79,0:27:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... please. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe nothing to this school, or this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.90,0:27:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go as far away as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.11,0:27:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this for yourself, not for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... do me one last favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.09,0:27:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.37,0:27:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Erase yourself from my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.89,0:27:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, I can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.31,0:28:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.44,0:28:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.17,0:28:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got him, Malfoy! He can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We should kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.54,0:28:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord will reward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.82,0:28:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.18,0:28:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.50,0:28:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.70,0:28:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my girlfriend, you fat idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.43,0:29:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it! We got the fangs and destroyed the Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.74,0:29:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.94,0:29:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright. She's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.98,0:29:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.07,0:29:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.56,0:29:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.02,0:29:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.93,0:29:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! I'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.70,0:29:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Ron?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.50,0:29:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruuuuunnn!!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.01,0:29:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Crabbe has lost his bloody mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.92,0:30:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, run! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruuuuunnn!!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.06,0:30:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,After all we went through to get in here, you're going to destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.27,0:30:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.96,0:30:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever laugh at us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.99,0:30:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.21,0:30:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,God...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.26,0:30:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.33,0:31:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help... help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.12,0:31:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Goyle, where's Crabbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.67,0:31:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,H-h-he... he burned...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.18,0:31:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,he burned... He burned!!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.78,0:31:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goyle, snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.46,0:31:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry for him later. We have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.53,0:31:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.89,0:31:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming! Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.40,0:31:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.99,0:32:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.29,0:32:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There, broomsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.93,0:32:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare drop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.22,0:32:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.81,0:32:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.97,0:32:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.26,0:32:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.14,0:32:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, for the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.16,0:32:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not leaving her, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.51,0:32:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been in love since first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.89,0:32:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's rubbish. They hate each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.22,0:32:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.62,0:32:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you've got the attention span of a pumpkin, Ronald Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.25,0:32:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.85,0:33:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.01,0:33:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No no no... faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The broom won't carry all three of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.34,0:33:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia... tell your father I'm not a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.69,0:33:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Goyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.58,0:33:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Goyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell my father to-
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.42,0:34:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.22,0:34:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron! Ron, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.50,0:34:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Blimey...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.85,0:34:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.88,0:34:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron! You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.71,0:34:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Diadem, it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.58,0:34:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The fangs, I've lost them!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.62,0:34:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.86,0:35:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We went through all that, just for these?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.35,0:35:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.22,0:35:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.29,0:35:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a basilisk's fang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.82,0:35:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the few things that can destroy the Diadem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.94,0:35:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Diadem is a Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.89,0:35:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort hid a piece of him inside it to make himself immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.42,0:35:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There were six. Only this one, and one more remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.99,0:35:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we destroy them both, we can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.78,0:35:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.46,0:36:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord... are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.79,0:36:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.88,0:36:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.74,0:36:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.28,0:36:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Volde's furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Nagini.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.11,0:37:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I must keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.74,0:37:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his connection to Voldemort!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.89,0:37:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry and Voldemort are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.78,0:37:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This happens whenever a Horcrux is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.06,0:37:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then help him, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.56,0:37:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't, we just have to wait for it to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.34,0:37:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione, give me some room please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.01,0:37:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.51,0:37:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.48,0:38:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Harry. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.39,0:38:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.18,0:38:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.78,0:38:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.46,0:38:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still cross with you for kissing Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.86,0:38:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I came looking for you the year before...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.38,0:38:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you pushed me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.30,0:38:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you didn't want anything to with me anymore, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.22,0:38:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.22,0:38:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After the ball, he ordered me to stay away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.62,0:38:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.71,0:38:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so frightened...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.50,0:38:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but not anymore, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.38,0:38:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back, and I'm not leaving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.88,0:39:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, she always finds her way back to you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.88,0:39:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.41,0:39:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.51,0:39:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.31,0:39:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.98,0:39:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.02,0:39:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.67,0:40:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.79,0:40:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.29,0:40:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dementor!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.74,0:40:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.34,0:40:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,OooooOoooOOOOooooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.46,0:41:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Harry since they killed Sirius Black right in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.48,0:41:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.06,0:41:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.77,0:41:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father... has been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.50,0:42:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.02,0:42:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.65,0:42:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove the loyalty and worth of your family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.45,0:42:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.24,0:42:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you dare use my own spells against me, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.90,0:42:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.69,0:42:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Half-Blood Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.74,0:42:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.12,0:42:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.62,0:43:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.72,0:43:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.01,0:43:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without my glasses...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.86,0:44:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.65,0:44:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.00,0:44:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,have we forgotten what we came here to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.31,0:44:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.68,0:44:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.50,0:44:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.02,0:44:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, that's madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.22,0:44:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He hardly ever leaves that stupid pet's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.02,0:44:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find him, we find the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.47,0:44:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.26,0:44:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.22,0:44:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get inside his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.07,0:44:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.48,0:44:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find him, we'll find the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.51,0:44:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I lie on your lap again? It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,this is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.70,0:45:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you hold my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.15,0:45:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.35,0:45:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.62,0:45:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be wiser to stop the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.14,0:45:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and search for the boy yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.32,0:45:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.51,0:45:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,because before this night is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.73,0:45:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,he will come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.28,0:45:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.49,0:45:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.94,0:46:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,he's with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.04,0:46:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My father?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.23,0:46:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.45,0:46:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just... talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.68,0:46:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucius, how can you claim to be pure blood, when you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.30,0:46:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.33,0:46:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.02,0:46:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.01,0:46:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and find Severus. Bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.52,0:46:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.48,0:46:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where they are! We have to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.42,0:46:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, quickly! Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.75,0:47:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We were told to show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.48,0:47:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even to the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.36,0:47:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought well, but I can't just leave like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.62,0:47:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.06,0:47:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fred!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.30,0:47:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Remus!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.91,0:48:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.91,0:48:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be spiders?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.05,0:48:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.97,0:49:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.55,0:49:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.86,0:49:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.86,0:49:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto... Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.06,0:49:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.43,0:50:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a few hours, you've performed extraordinary magic with that wand, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.33,0:50:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.38,0:50:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.82,0:50:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But the wand...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.34,0:50:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it resists me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.48,0:50:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no more powerful wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.58,0:50:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Olivander himself said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.42,0:50:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When the boy comes tonight, it will not fail you, I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.37,0:50:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It answers to you, and you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.07,0:50:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.50,0:50:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord-
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.44,0:50:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The wand, does it truly answer to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.37,0:50:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a clever man, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.48,0:50:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you must understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.03,0:50:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to whom does it truly owe its allegiance?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To you of course, my  Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.07,0:50:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand cannot serve me properly...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.38,0:50:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,because I am not its true master.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.63,0:50:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand belongs to the wizard who kills its previous owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.72,0:51:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Dumbledore, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.26,0:51:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you live, the Elder Wand can never truly be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.37,0:51:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been a good and faithful servant, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.15,0:51:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But only I can live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.70,0:51:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.71,0:51:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My little one, dinner is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.54,0:51:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.34,0:51:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.69,0:52:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,T... Take... Take them...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.22,0:52:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.01,0:52:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.86,0:52:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have... your mother's eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.58,0:52:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.96,0:52:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.61,0:52:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,what I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.49,0:52:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You were...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.73,0:52:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,my finest student...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.75,0:53:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and the finest Slytherin...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.90,0:53:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.10,0:53:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... don't stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.64,0:53:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fred, open your eyes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.94,0:53:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Brave. But not the one I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.41,0:53:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginny!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.43,0:53:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.65,0:54:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.64,0:54:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Slytherins.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.42,0:54:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's our pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.47,0:54:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Weasley!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.19,0:54:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.70,0:54:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.22,0:54:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see her like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.75,0:55:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.15,0:56:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.54,0:56:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.75,0:56:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My children...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.36,0:56:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.42,0:57:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.41,0:57:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.56,0:57:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,thank goodness you're alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.49,0:57:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,George?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.73,0:57:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I George?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.69,0:57:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or am I Fred?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.55,0:57:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which one I want to be anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.60,0:57:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.52,0:57:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this want you wanted, Potter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.06,0:57:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my parents three years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.18,0:57:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had left were my two brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.39,0:57:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.57,0:58:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and I promised I'd protect them...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.11,0:58:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and they killed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.22,0:58:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They murdered them, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.61,0:58:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing left!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.94,0:58:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.00,0:58:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.51,0:58:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.43,0:58:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! She's marked!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.14,0:58:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.88,0:58:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.55,0:58:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.15,0:58:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.26,0:58:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.47,0:58:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody touches her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.91,0:58:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy who lived! You're a fraud!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.46,0:58:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.56,0:58:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.72,0:58:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you! Haven't we lost enough tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.24,0:59:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These two are not your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.66,0:59:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.47,0:59:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.26,0:59:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.03,0:59:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no victors while we're still counting our dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.30,0:59:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.51,0:59:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived through one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.41,0:59:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And it never stops hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.63,0:59:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we don't end this, tomorrow there'll be more bodies in that hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.06,0:59:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even those of us who've seen it before...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.53,0:59:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we never get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.65,0:59:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fought valiantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.88,0:59:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.51,0:59:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not wish for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.79,1:00:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every drop of magical blood spilt...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.82,1:00:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,is a terrible loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.35,1:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I have ordered my forces to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.01,1:00:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay your dead to rest with dignity...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.57,1:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and tend to your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.69,1:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.26,1:00:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I speak directly to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.22,1:00:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You allowed your friends to fight and die for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.16,1:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than face me yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.97,1:00:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to live with such dishonour?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.02,1:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet me in the forbidden forest...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.42,1:00:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and face your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:01:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, this time no one will be left alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.24,1:01:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.93,1:01:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my support.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.99,1:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But we cannot withstand another assault.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.27,1:01:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I cannot ask anyone else to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.09,1:01:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already lost too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.82,1:01:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where-
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.53,1:01:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go to the pensieve first.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.89,1:01:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.00,1:01:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:01:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.16,1:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We welcomed you into our home!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.16,1:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We fed you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.74,1:02:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We stood by you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.60,1:02:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what happened!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.05,1:02:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginny... my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.74,1:02:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,my little girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.32,1:02:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and Fred!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.65,1:02:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My Fred!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.48,1:03:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.97,1:03:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too far to stop now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.05,1:03:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to see this through...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.21,1:03:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.48,1:03:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.43,1:03:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.80,1:03:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron... I... I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.93,1:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't apologise.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.03,1:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.75,1:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise me we're gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.72,1:03:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope there's something in what Snape left us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.40,1:03:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember when I found you on the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.33,1:03:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.26,1:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd known what was coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.98,1:03:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.12,1:03:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you got a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.31,1:03:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.64,1:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.03,1:04:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how tonight will end...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.92,1:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.98,1:04:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you an apology, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.97,1:04:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For everything I ever said to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.34,1:04:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.76,1:04:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always thought you were a brilliant witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.07,1:04:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant enough that...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.18,1:04:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually jealous of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.77,1:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.96,1:04:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealous of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.79,1:04:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.21,1:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're brilliant too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.43,1:04:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that time in second year?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.42,1:04:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The exam?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.81,1:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't remind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.59,1:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the results of your recent exams.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.64,1:04:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.41,1:04:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two students achieved full marks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.41,1:04:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.32,1:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.69,1:05:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're living proof hard work beats talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.21,1:05:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you've got both.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.26,1:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.62,1:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That means a lot, coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.22,1:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you two take so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.38,1:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.11,1:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.52,1:05:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been fighting since first year...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.54,1:05:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but I could tell you just wanted his attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.82,1:05:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.57,1:05:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't start feeling anything until fourth year.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.39,1:05:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But there were problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.46,1:05:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that brought us here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.65,1:05:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was jealous of you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.50,1:05:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always so close to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.99,1:05:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For a moment, I even thought you two might...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.35,1:05:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.86,1:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.92,1:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the way you're thinking!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.46,1:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were hunting Horcruxes, we were alone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.73,1:06:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.67,1:06:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We realised it simply wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.32,1:06:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the way it does with you and him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.39,1:06:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.98,1:06:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You two were meant to find each other from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.42,1:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm better off with my redhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.64,1:06:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taller.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.25,1:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry's much better looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.90,1:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. Ron's better looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.91,1:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream on. Harry is.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.98,1:06:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron is-
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.42,1:06:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Granger!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.62,1:06:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me go back to who I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.87,1:06:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione's prettier.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.12,1:06:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.10,1:06:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia's got better legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And a fully figure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.50,1:06:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No contest.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.38,1:07:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Snape want to show us?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.22,1:07:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.95,1:07:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.02,1:07:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Snivellus?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.98,1:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropped your homework?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.61,1:07:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter! You bloody bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.55,1:08:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sectumsempra!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.71,1:08:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, Snivellus!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.61,1:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,James Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.99,1:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him down! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.22,1:08:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was a great man!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.70,1:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a swine!!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.79,1:08:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Severus... are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.67,1:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.34,1:08:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy mudblood!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.70,1:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.65,1:09:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.28,1:09:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.54,1:09:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.09,1:09:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks it's her son!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.14,1:09:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And what will you give me in return, Severus?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.27,1:09:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.46,1:09:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just please... protect them!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.50,1:09:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd keep them safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.19,1:10:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They trusted the wrong person, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.78,1:10:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They were betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.59,1:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But the boy survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.35,1:10:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And he has her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.42,1:10:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.16,1:10:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But the boy doesn't need protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.74,1:10:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.94,1:10:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He will return.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.38,1:10:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And when he does, the boy will be in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.72,1:10:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly loved her...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.10,1:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No one must ever know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.15,1:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall never reveal your better side, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.78,1:10:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as you spend every day of your life protecting him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.71,1:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sectumsempra.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.70,1:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This will contain the curse in your hand for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.78,1:11:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But it will spread.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.26,1:11:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.54,1:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A year.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.75,1:11:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps less.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.27,1:11:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not ignore me, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.68,1:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know Voldemort ordered the Malfoy girl to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.90,1:11:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But something happened that even he did not forsee.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.22,1:12:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She has fallen in love with Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.20,1:12:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Between that love and her fear, she will never be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.98,1:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means the Dark Lord will inevitably turn to you, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.99,1:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You must do it, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.22,1:12:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You must kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.40,1:12:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will Voldemort trust you completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.86,1:12:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.70,1:12:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But once you are close to him, you must not attempt to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.91,1:12:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You must wait until he is vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.01,1:12:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that to happen, Harry Potter must learn something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.62,1:12:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.13,1:12:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What must he learn?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.43,1:12:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That night in Godric's Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.50,1:13:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When Voldemort killed Lily and then tried to kill Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.40,1:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,his curse rebounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.86,1:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A fragment of Voldemort's soul broke away,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.04,1:13:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and attached itself to the only living thing nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.43,1:13:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.70,1:13:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why Harry can speak to snakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.97,1:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why he can see into Voldemort's mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.37,1:13:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Because a part of Voldemort lives inside him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.23,1:13:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the time comes, the boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.82,1:13:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.42,1:13:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.14,1:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.05,1:14:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And Voldemort himmself must do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.78,1:14:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is essential.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.55,1:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have kept him alive, so that he can die at the proper moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.66,1:14:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've raised him like a pig for slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.06,1:14:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've grown to care for the boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.49,1:14:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.99,1:14:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily? After all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.62,1:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.58,1:14:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.76,1:14:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.02,1:15:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.42,1:15:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, please, you're frightening me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.82,1:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's... another...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.42,1:15:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,another Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.51,1:15:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.34,1:15:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.06,1:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything we've been though, destroying the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.50,1:15:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another one besides the snake?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.99,1:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.11,1:15:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you already know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.80,1:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.69,1:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.95,1:15:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can see into his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.42,1:15:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why I can speak to snakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.84,1:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.34,1:16:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a part of Voldemort inside him...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.86,1:16:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry is the Horcrux!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.59,1:16:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.48,1:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No no no...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.58,1:16:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.14,1:16:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.51,1:16:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.07,1:16:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.05,1:16:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.70,1:16:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Please no!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.59,1:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! This is Dumbledore's office!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.48,1:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.60,1:17:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A potion, a spell, a ritual...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.92,1:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Something!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.96,1:17:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.84,1:17:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Horcrux are difficult enough to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.47,1:17:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to remove the fragment of soul trapped inside them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.21,1:17:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and help me, Granger!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.54,1:17:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.64,1:17:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, you must kill the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.13,1:17:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be a way to get it out of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.69,1:17:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.81,1:17:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.24,1:17:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After all these years, you're just letting him go?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.09,1:18:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're his friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.45,1:18:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to do anything?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.22,1:18:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You bloody idiots!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.75,1:18:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.54,1:18:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.09,1:18:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.02,1:18:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.00,1:18:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it weren't for this thing inside me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.58,1:18:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd still kill everyone before sunrise if I don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.44,1:18:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if we killed the snake,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.80,1:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as part of his soul lives inside me,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.11,1:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.66,1:18:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And everything we've done...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.87,1:18:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,would have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.99,1:18:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only way to destroy it...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.09,1:18:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is for him to do it himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.92,1:19:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or someone could stab me with a basilisk fang.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.38,1:19:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe me,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.06,1:19:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fan of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.04,1:19:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.86,1:19:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that he gets to decide whether we live or die!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.69,1:19:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already taken so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.51,1:19:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He stole your chance to have a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.22,1:19:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And he forbade me from ever being happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.76,1:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I needed another reason to hate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.31,1:19:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate him almost as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.18,1:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything we've been through, we're finally together.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.52,1:19:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.41,1:19:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he's tearing us apart again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.94,1:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.79,1:19:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.75,1:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get our brooms and leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.07,1:19:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Romania...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.29,1:19:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,France...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.50,1:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps even North America.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.01,1:19:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As far away as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.21,1:19:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you told me in the Room of Requirement today?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.13,1:20:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.01,1:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter where I go...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.29,1:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll never stop hunting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.33,1:20:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll always find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.23,1:20:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll kill as many people as he can along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.78,1:20:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I may carry part of his soul inside me...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.31,1:20:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.66,1:20:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The difference is...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.70,1:20:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't ignore other people's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.14,1:20:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I told you that once, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.34,1:20:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people have already died because of me today.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.50,1:20:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I run away...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.94,1:20:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.29,1:20:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, my love, please...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.28,1:20:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you manage to kill the snake...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.66,1:20:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and defeat him...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.11,1:20:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,please...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.85,1:20:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,don't hold onto the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.53,1:20:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.22,1:20:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,towards tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.76,1:20:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and finally... be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.41,1:21:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.06,1:21:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.78,1:21:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you love me, please...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.22,1:21:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.85,1:21:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.91,1:21:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I do...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.83,1:21:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to take another step away from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.36,1:21:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Im... Imperi...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.55,1:21:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperi...!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.49,1:21:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperio...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.82,1:22:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.34,1:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!!
